OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 13, arrested over Halloween
OL,4,Astabbing of teen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a another teenager was stabbed in
OL,8,FWolverhampton.
OL,10,FA group were involved in an altercation
OL,11,Fin the Staveley area on Saturday
OL,12,Fevening during which a firework was let
OL,13,Foff in Francis Street and the teenager
OL,14,Fwas stabbed in the arm, West Midlands
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FThe 13-year-old was arrested on Monday
OL,18,Fat an address in Whitmore Reans on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of wounding with intent and
OL,20,Fremained in custody, the force added.
